/T (Thisprojectpresentsthemodellingandanalysisofasingle-phase AC electric tractionpowersupplysystemusingMATLAB/Simulink,withafocus on improving source-sidepowerqualitythroughpassiveharmonicfilters.Modernrailway traction networksrelyheavilyonpowerelectronicconvertersandrectifier-fed motor drives. Whiletheseconvertersenablecontrolled,efficientpropulsion,theybehave as non- linearloadsandinjectsignificantharmoniccurrentsintothesupply network. The injectedharmonicsdistortthesourcecurrentwaveform,degradethedisplacement and distortioncomponentsofthepowerfactor,increasecopperandironlosses in the feeder transformer,andmayinterferewithneighborsignallingandcommunication circuits. )
/E (Thisprojectpresentsthemodellingandanalysisofasingle-phase AC electric tractionpowersupplysystemusingMATLAB/Simulink,withafocus on improving source-sidepowerqualitythroughpassiveharmonicfilters.Modernrailway traction networksrelyheavilyonpowerelectronicconvertersandrectifier-fed motor drives. Whiletheseconvertersenablecontrolled,efficientpropulsion,theybehave as non- linearloadsandinjectsignificantharmoniccurrentsintothesupply network. The injectedharmonicsdistortthesourcecurrentwaveform,degradethedisplacement and distortioncomponentsofthepowerfactor,increasecopperandironlosses in the feeder transformer,andmayinterferewithneighborsignallingandcommunication circuits. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
