1477 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 1089 0 R
/T (The motor block is connected to a rotational damper that emulates the running resistance of the traction load. The selected damping coefficient is adjusted such that the motor operates close to its rated terminal voltage and rated armature current during the simulation, thereby reproducing realistic locomotive operating conditions on a reduced scale.  3.6 Simulink Model)
/E (The motor block is connected to a rotational damper that emulates the running resistance of the traction load. The selected damping coefficient is adjusted such that the motor operates close to its rated terminal voltage and rated armature current during the simulation, thereby reproducing realistic locomotive operating conditions on a reduced scale.  3.6 Simulink Model)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [11]
>>
