/P 1095 0 R
/T (The unfiltered simulation, the waveform of which has already been presented in Fig. 4.1, is post-processed by the harmonicanalysis.m MATLAB script. The script reads the exported workspace variables out.currentsignal and out.acvoltage, computes the RMS values, the active power, the apparent power and the THD, and prints the results to the command window. The captured output of the script for the unfiltered case is shown in Fig. 5.1. )
/E (The unfiltered simulation, the waveform of which has already been presented in Fig. 4.1, is post-processed by the harmonicanalysis.m MATLAB script. The script reads the exported workspace variables out.currentsignal and out.acvoltage, computes the RMS values, the active power, the apparent power and the THD, and prints the results to the command window. The captured output of the script for the unfiltered case is shown in Fig. 5.1. )
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
