/E (The power factor improved significantly after the integration of passive harmonic filters. The unfiltered system exhibited a power factor of 0.587, indicating poor power quality due to the presence of substantial harmonic distortion. After filter implementation, the power factor increased to 0.820, demonstrating improved utilization of electrical power. )
