<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1098 0 R
/E (This improvement is primarily due to the reduction of lower-order harmonics and the increase in the fundamental current component. The results confirm that passive harmonic filtering is effective in enhancing the power quality of the AC traction supply system while reducing the adverse effects of harmonic distortion. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [40]
>>
