6297 0 obj
<<
/Title (The completeunfilteredSimulink model is shown in Fig. 3.1. The model is built using the SimscapeElectricalSpecialised Power Systems library. Voltage and current measurement blocksareplaced on the AC side, together with the Powergui block configured in Continuousmode. The Powergui block also hosts the FFT Analysis tool that is used in Chapter4toobtain the harmonic spectrum of the source current.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6291 0 R
/Prev 6295 0 R
/Next 6299 0 R
